[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
title = "Workbench"
brief_tooltip = "Right-click workbench to open crafting panel.
View available recipes and material costs.
Central hub for all construction projects."
detailed_text = "[b]The Workbench[/b]

[i]Shipwrecked crews throughout history have turned salvaged timber and fittings into shelters, boats, and tools. Everything your men build starts with raw materials pulled from the wreck of Terror.[/i]

The workbench is where all construction begins. Your men deposit salvaged materials here, and you choose what to build with them.

[b]How to Use[/b]

1. Right-click the workbench to open the panel
2. The left side shows what you can build; the right shows your stockpile
3. Recipes you can afford are highlighted; those you cannot are greyed out
4. Click a recipe to begin placement — a preview appears on the terrain
5. Hover any recipe button for its full cost and build time

[b]Materials[/b]

Your men gather these from the ship and deposit them here automatically:
• [b]Scrap Wood[/b] — The primary building material
• [b]Nails[/b] — Required for most structures
• [b]Sail Scraps[/b] — Needed for tents

Your material stockpile is shared across all projects, so plan your build order.

[b]Tips[/b]

• Hover greyed-out recipes to see exactly what you are missing
• Keep the workbench clear and accessible — men need to reach it
• Prioritise what you build; you may not have enough materials for everything
• Press ESC to close the panel without starting anything"
